        {
            "title": "Please reinstall the game to clean up old installation paths",
            "date": "2021-02-28 10:34:42",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4060529371713375863",
            "content": "The architecture of the game has been changed. Reinstallation is required, to clean up the old installation paths, before starting, uninstall and install the game again. This will update the game loader."
        },
        {
            "title": "Внимание!",
            "date": "2021-02-21 07:35:01",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4059402835320537532",
            "content": "Внимание! \nИгра может не запустится, сейчас мы настраиваем новую архитектуру игры!\nЧерез какое-то время, проблема с запуском будет устранена! Это займёт 30 - 40 минут!"
        },
